 208:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8575_phy.c **** /**************************************************************************/ /**
 209:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8575_phy.c ****                                                                               * Note: The following
 210:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8575_phy.c ****                                                                               * assumes there is
 211:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8575_phy.c ****                                                                               * only one VSC8757 PH
 212:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8575_phy.c ****                                                                               * in the system. We
 213:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8575_phy.c ****                                                                               * will need to revisi
 214:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8575_phy.c ****                                                                               * it at some stage to
 215:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8575_phy.c ****                                                                               * provide for multipl
 216:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8575_phy.c ****                                                                               *       devices
 217:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8575_phy.c ****                                                                               * connected to
 218:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8575_phy.c ****                                                                               * separate GEMs or fo
 219:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8575_phy.c ****                                                                               * the case of multipl
 220:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8575_phy.c ****                                                                               *       GEMs connecte
 221:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8575_phy.c ****                                                                               * to the same PHY but
 222:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8575_phy.c ****                                                                               * to different ports.
 223:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8575_phy.c ****                                                                               *
 224:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8575_phy.c ****                                                                               *       For now we
 225:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8575_phy.c ****                                                                               * need to at least
 226:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8575_phy.c ****                                                                               * record somewhere
 227:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8575_phy.c ****                                                                               * which GEM this PHY
 228:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8575_phy.c ****                                                                               *       is associated
 229:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8575_phy.c ****                                                                               * with so that the
 230:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8575_phy.c ****                                                                               * MDIO functions can
 231:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8575_phy.c ****                                                                               * work correctly as i
 232:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8575_phy.c ****                                                                               * is currently assume
 233:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8575_phy.c ****                                                                               * GEM0 is the one
 234:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8575_phy.c ****                                                                               * connected to the
 235:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8575_phy.c ****                                                                               * VSC8575.
 236:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8575_phy.c ****                                                                               *
 237:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8575_phy.c ****                                                                               *       May need to
 238:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8575_phy.c ****                                                                               * consider adding
 239:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8575_phy.c ****                                                                               * entry to vtss_inst_
 240:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8575_phy.c ****                                                                               * to hold the mac
 241:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8575_phy.c ****                                                                               *       reference so
 242:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8575_phy.c ****                                                                               * MDIO can figure out
 243:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8575_phy.c ****                                                                               * who to talk to. Thi
 244:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8575_phy.c ****                                                                               * will also mean that
 245:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8575_phy.c ****                                                                               * the some or all of
 246:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8575_phy.c ****                                                                               * following globals
 247:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8575_phy.c ****                                                                               * will need to be
 248:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8575_phy.c ****                                                                               * changed to allow fo
 249:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8575_phy.c ****                                                                               * multiple
 250:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8575_phy.c ****                                                                               * connections...
 251:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8575_phy.c ****                                                                               *
 252:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8575_phy.c ****                                                                               */
 253:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_ethernet_mac/vsc8575_phy.c **** 
